  "captions": [
    {
      "start": 1.03,
      "end": 3.53,
      "text": "Morevna Project..."
    },
    {
      "start": 4.37,
      "end": 6.78,
      "text": "...in association with \"Ethic Cinema\"..."
    },
    {
      "start": 7.24,
      "end": 8.51,
      "text": "...presents."
    },
    {
      "start": 24.24,
      "end": 28.24,
      "text": "Oh, I fell asleep with the window open again..."
    },
    {
      "start": 29.96,
      "end": 32.76,
      "text": "Ufff... it's so windy..."
    },
    {
      "start": 33.62,
      "end": 36.91,
      "text": "...and why can I see Komona through the window?"
    },
    {
      "start": 37.24,
      "end": 38.24,
      "text": "Komona?!"
    },
    {
      "start": 39.2,
      "end": 39.99,
      "text": "THE CONTEST!!!"
    },
    {
      "start": 41.7,
      "end": 43.28,
      "text": "In previous episodes:"
    },
    {
      "start": 43.45,
      "end": 45.49,
      "text": "Pepper spent a lot of effort..."
    },
    {
      "start": 45.87,
      "end": 49.49,
      "text": "...preparing for the potion contest."
    },
    {
      "start": 50.04,
      "end": 50.87,
      "text": "I must've..."
    },
    {
      "start": 51.21,
      "end": 54,
      "text": "...must've accidentally fallen asleep..."
    },
    {
      "start": 54.47,
      "end": 55.1,
      "text": "But..."
    },
    {
      "start": 56.18,
      "end": 57.32,
      "text": "But...where am I?"
    },
    {
      "start": 58.22,
      "end": 59.16,
      "text": "Oh!!!"
    },
    {
      "start": 64.88,
      "end": 68.58,
      "text": "Carrot! It's so cute that you took care of everything!"
    },
    {
      "start": 69.64,
      "end": 70.64,
      "text": "Meow!"
    },
    {
      "start": 71.62,
      "end": 76.04,
      "text": "You even thought to bring a potion, my clothes, and my hat!"
    },
    {
      "start": 77.12,
      "end": 80.67,
      "text": "Well, let's see which potion you brought."
    },
    {
      "start": 81.17,
      "end": 83.04,
      "text": "So, what do we have here?"
    },
    {
      "start": 83.87,
      "end": 85.87,
      "text": "Whaaaat?!"
    },
    {
      "start": 88.74,
      "end": 92.84,
      "text": "Caaaaaaarrrrrooooooot!!!!!!!"
    },
    {
      "start": 93.64,
      "end": 97.4,
      "text": "Pepper & Carrot. Episode 6: The Potion Contest"
    },
    {
      "start": 98.33,
      "end": 103.12,
      "text": "As Mayor of Komona, I declare the potion contest..."
    },
    {
      "start": 103.42,
      "end": 105.08,
      "text": "...open!"
    },
    {
      "start": 106.87,
      "end": 110.87,
      "text": "Four young witches are participating in this contest!"
    },
    {
      "start": 111.92,
      "end": 114.54,
      "text": "Please give a huge round of applause!"
    },
    {
      "start": 120.62,
      "end": 124.62,
      "text": "It is an honor to welcome the ravishing and ingenious witch..."
    },
    {
      "start": 125.21,
      "end": 127.67,
      "text": "...from the great Technologist's Union!!!.."
    },
    {
      "start": 128.04,
      "end": 131.78,
      "text": "Coriander!"
    },
    {
      "start": 133.04,
      "end": 137.71,
      "text": "And don't forget about our local girl, Komona's very own witch..."
    },
    {
      "start": 138.08,
      "end": 140.96,
      "text": "Saffron!"
    },
    {
      "start": 146.66,
      "end": 148.92,
      "text": "Our third participant..."
    },
    {
      "start": 149.14,
      "end": 152.58,
      "text": "...comes to us from the lands of the setting moons..."
    },
    {
      "start": 153.04,
      "end": 154.92,
      "text": "...the mysterious..."
    },
    {
      "start": 155.9,
      "end": 158.34,
      "text": "...Shichimi!"
    },
    {
      "start": 160.12,
      "end": 164.52,
      "text": "And finally our last participant, from the forest of Squirrel's End..."
    },
    {
      "start": 164.82,
      "end": 166.3,
      "text": "...Pepper."
    },
    {
      "start": 169.34,
      "end": 170.78,
      "text": "Ladies and gentlemen!"
    },
    {
      "start": 170.87,
      "end": 176.46,
      "text": "The winner of the grand prize will be determined by applaud-o-meter!"
    },
    {
      "start": 176.58,
      "end": 180.42,
      "text": "Let the games begin!"
    },
    {
      "start": 182.58,
      "end": 187.37,
      "text": "Well! First up Coriander's demonstration."
    },
    {
      "start": 189.83,
      "end": 191.5,
      "text": "Ladies & gentlemen..."
    },
    {
      "start": 191.96,
      "end": 195.04,
      "text": "...fear death no more, thanks to my..."
    },
    {
      "start": 195.67,
      "end": 197.37,
      "text": "...Potion of Zombification!"
    },
    {
      "start": 207.98,
      "end": 209.7,
      "text": "Amazing!"
    },
    {
      "start": 210.56,
      "end": 217.18,
      "text": "With this mi-ra-cu-lous potion, Coriander defies death itself!"
    },
    {
      "start": 218.54,
      "end": 220.62,
      "text": "Yes-yes-yes..."
    },
    {
      "start": 221.46,
      "end": 223.52,
      "text": "A potion of Zombification.."
    },
    {
      "start": 223.92,
      "end": 225.2,
      "text": "that's nothing!"
    },
    {
      "start": 225.21,
      "end": 227.33,
      "text": "It's time to rate MY potion."
    },
    {
      "start": 227.83,
      "end": 231.83,
      "text": "The real potion you've all been waiting for..."
    },
    {
      "start": 236.48,
      "end": 238.38,
      "text": "...The Potion of Poshness!"
    },
    {
      "start": 241.12,
      "end": 243.71,
      "text": "Fantastic!"
    },
    {
      "start": 243.96,
      "end": 245.75,
      "text": "Incredible!"
    },
    {
      "start": 246.29,
      "end": 250.8,
      "text": "This potion could make all of Komona rich!"
    },
    {
      "start": 250.96,
      "end": 253.58,
      "text": "It seems, Coriander has already been eliminated!"
    },
    {
      "start": 253.87,
      "end": 257.87,
      "text": "Will Shichimi be able to beat that last demonstration?"
    },
    {
      "start": 258.83,
      "end": 262.7,
      "text": "I... I did not know we had to give a demonstration."
    },
    {
      "start": 263.04,
      "end": 264.37,
      "text": "Come on Shichimi!"
    },
    {
      "start": 264.42,
      "end": 265.79,
      "text": "Everyone's waiting for you!"
    },
    {
      "start": 266.33,
      "end": 267.17,
      "text": "No!.."
    },
    {
      "start": 267.58,
      "end": 268.12,
      "text": "I cannot!.."
    },
    {
      "start": 268.46,
      "end": 270.2,
      "text": "It is too dangerous!.."
    },
    {
      "start": 270.4,
      "end": 271.64,
      "text": "S-sorry!.."
    },
    {
      "start": 272.37,
      "end": 273.75,
      "text": "Ladies and gentlemen..."
    },
    {
      "start": 274,
      "end": 275.5,
      "text": "...it seems that Shichimi forfeits..."
    },
    {
      "start": 275.54,
      "end": 276.42,
      "text": "Give me that!"
    },
    {
      "start": 276.58,
      "end": 277.37,
      "text": "CAREFUL!!!"
    },
    {
      "start": 277.66,
      "end": 279.48,
      "text": "What could be so dangerous?"
    },
    {
      "start": 279.68,
      "end": 283.46,
      "text": "You're just scared because your potion isn't as fantastic as mine!"
    },
    {
      "start": 284.58,
      "end": 286.9,
      "text": "No-no, it is a potion of..."
    },
    {
      "start": 287.96,
      "end": 290.84,
      "text": "...GIANT MONSTERS!!!"
    },
    {
      "start": 298.1,
      "end": 299.94,
      "text": "Mr. Mayor, Mr. Mayor!"
    },
    {
      "start": 300.1,
      "end": 301.26,
      "text": "Is it my turn now???"
    },
    {
      "start": 301.28,
      "end": 302.34,
      "text": "Run!"
    },
    {
      "start": 307.52,
      "end": 311.26,
      "text": "You're lucky, Carrot; It seems nobody will see your wondrous potion..."
    },
    {
      "start": 311.5,
      "end": 313.6,
      "text": "She will destroy our town!!!"
    },
    {
      "start": 314.72,
      "end": 317.76,
      "text": "Wait, I think I have an idea!"
    },
    {
      "start": 326.06,
      "end": 326.96,
      "text": "Hey!"
    },
    {
      "start": 327.44,
      "end": 330.06,
      "text": "You oversized-posh-zombie-canary!"
    },
    {
      "start": 330.12,
      "end": 332.37,
      "text": "Wanna try one last \"potion\"?"
    },
    {
      "start": 333.42,
      "end": 334.71,
      "text": "But first..."
    },
    {
      "start": 334.79,
      "end": 337,
      "text": "...read the label!"
    },
    {
      "start": 337.92,
      "end": 339.48,
      "text": "Read it carefully!"
    },
    {
      "start": 344.36,
      "end": 349.92,
      "text": "If you don't get out of Komona right away, trust me: I'll pour it all over you!"
    },
    {
      "start": 350.58,
      "end": 351.25,
      "text": "Understood?!"
    },
    {
      "start": 375.71,
      "end": 380.74,
      "text": "Because she saved our town we award first place to..."
    },
    {
      "start": 380.79,
      "end": 383.04,
      "text": "...Miss Pepper!"
    },
    {
      "start": 383.24,
      "end": 385.28,
      "text": "For her wonderful potion!"
    },
    {
      "start": 386.02,
      "end": 387.33,
      "text": "Huh, in fact..."
    },
    {
      "start": 387.58,
      "end": 389.29,
      "text": "...it's not really a potion..."
    },
    {
      "start": 389.42,
      "end": 392.58,
      "text": "...it's just my cat's pee sample from his last trip to the vet!"
    },
    {
      "start": 393.17,
      "end": 394.17,
      "text": "Isn't it, Carrot?"
    },
    {
      "start": 395.71,
      "end": 396.42,
      "text": "Meow!"
    }
  ],
